Hardware</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-8 text-slate-300"><div id="careers" class="absolute max-md:-top-16"></div><div><h1 class="relative flex items-center text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-tight text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" height="32" class="right-full mr-2 text-emerald-600 md:absolute md:top-1/2 md:-translate-y-1/2 shrink-0"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"></path></svg>Careers</h1><br/><p>We&#x27;re a lean, self-funded, distributed team and we&#x27;re always hiring.</p><br/><p>Help us build and explore new infrastructure to amplify the human spirit. <a draggable="false" class="text-blue-400 underline hover:underline-offset-2" href="/careers">Learn more.</a></p></div></section><section class="flex flex-col gap-8 text-slate-300"><div id="contact" class="absolute max-md:-top-16"></div><div><h1 class="relative flex items-center text-2xl md:text-3xl leading-tight  text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" height="32" class="right-full mr-2 text-yellow-500 md:absolute md:top-1/2 md:-translate-y-1/2 shrink-0"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>Contact</h1><br/><p>For product questions and support go to our <a href="https://discord.gg/midjourney" class="text-blue-400 underline hover:underline-offset-2">Discord</a> or <a href="https://help.midjourney.com" class="text-blue-400 underline hover:underline-offset-2">help page</a>.</p><br/><p>For billing support email us at: <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#7d1f14111114131a3d1014191712080f131804531e1210" class="text-blue-400 underline hover:underline-offset-2"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="b8dad1d4d4d1d6dff8d5d1dcd2d7cdcad6ddc196dbd7d5">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p><br/><p>For journalistic inquiries: <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#0a7a786f79794a67636e60657f78646f7324696567" class="text-blue-400 underline hover:underline-offset-2"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="7c0c0e190f0f3c1115181613090e121905521f1311">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p></div></section><section class="flex justify-center gap-8"><a class="text-sm underline-offset-2 opacity-70 hover:underline" href="https://docs.midjourney.com/hc/en-us/articles/32083055291277-Terms-of-Service">Terms of Service</a><a class="text-sm underline-offset-2 opacity-70 hover:underline" href="https://docs.midjourney.com/hc/en-us/articles/32083472637453-Privacy-Policy">Privacy Policy</a><button class="text-sm underline-offset-2 opacity-70 hover:underline">Privacy settings</button></section></div></div></main></div><div style="position:fixed;z-index:10003;top:16px;left:16px;right:16px;bottom:16px;pointer-events:none"></div></div><script data-cfasync="false" src="/cdn-cgi/scripts/5c5dd728/cloudflare-static/email-decode.min.js"></script><script type="module" src="/public/out/clientSideEntry-9x3zzy4w.js"></script><script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML="window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a414f3403a19a407',t:'MTc5MDQ1MzgyNg=='};var a=document.createElement('script');a.src='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js';document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOM